{"ID":"20250919154952-4bba43p","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250919154952-4bba43p","title":"UPL6-5——SRP Batcher","type":"doc","updated":"20251125162710"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919154953-7fmpcqe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250919154953-7fmpcqe","updated":"20250922112058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SRP Batcher"}]},{"ID":"20250919160107-k03f6cj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919160107-k03f6cj","updated":"20250919160143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SRP Batcher（Scriptable Render Pipeline Batcher）是 Unity 在可编程渲染管线，比如 URP、HDRP 中提供的一项 CPU 优化技术\n主要目的是用于降低 材质切换 带来的开销"}]},{"ID":"20250919160107-5ifammg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919160107-5ifammg","updated":"20250919160356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要解决的问题：\n每次 DrawCall 不仅要告诉 GPU 画哪个网格，还要上传 材质常量（Shader 参数），\n不同物体哪怕使用同一个 Shader，但只要材质不同，CPU 就要重新设置常量缓冲区（Constant Buffer），这一步就叫做 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SetPass"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SetPass"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 开销很大，在复杂场景里，CPU 花在切换材质的时间常常比真正发 DrawCall 还多，而 SRP Batcher 就是用来解决这一问题的"}]},{"ID":"20250922110850-c26puyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110850-c26puyh","updated":"20250922111029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"SROShaderPass"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/SROShaderPass-20250922110907-b00ojgg.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"批量处理绑定和绘制命令可以减少绘制调用之间的 GPU 设置开销"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250919160107-c3dsqpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919160107-c3dsqpq","updated":"20250919160549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要原理：Unity 在 GPU 显存中为 Shader 的常量缓冲区分配了两个区域："}]},{"ID":"20250919160238-9fv6noh","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919160238-9fv6noh","updated":"20250919160256"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919160238-icqc3h5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919160238-icqc3h5","updated":"20250919160253"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919160238-wjsgcxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919160238-wjsgcxf","updated":"20250919160238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"材质缓冲区："}]},{"ID":"20250919160246-4u4zarf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919160246-4u4zarf","updated":"20250919160253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"存储材质相关的参数（颜色、贴图索引 等数据），存放在 GPU 可缓存的大缓冲池里，不用每次切换材质都重新上传"}]}]},{"ID":"20250919160238-qlwq1gh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250919160238-qlwq1gh","updated":"20250919160256"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919160238-fs2wgyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919160238-fs2wgyu","updated":"20250919160238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物体缓冲区："}]},{"ID":"20250919160247-md19ekk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919160247-md19ekk","updated":"20250919160256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"存储物体相关的参数（变换矩阵、光照探针 等数据），只更新每个物体独有的少量数据"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250919160231-oeoxc4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919160231-oeoxc4t","updated":"20250922111134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 CPU 这边：只有内容变化时才更新数据，避免每帧为每个物体和材质重复准备和上传参数\n达到的效果：DrawCall 数量不变，但 CPU 不再频繁计算和上传数据，大幅降低 CPU 到 GPU 的通信开销"}]},{"ID":"20250922110917-una6go9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110917-una6go9","updated":"20250922111328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250922110918-eqpdtt3.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"SRP Batcher 渲染工作流程：SRP Batcher 使用专用的代码路径，在一个大型 GPU 缓冲区中更新 Unity 引擎属性。"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250919160107-1wd0xs7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919160107-1wd0xs7","updated":"20250922111547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说人话：\nSRP Batcher 是 SRP 下的一种 CPU 优化机制，通过把物体和材质数据缓存到 GPU，减少计算和上传开销，从而让同一 Shader 的不同材质也能高效批量绘制\n严格意义上来说 SRP Batcher 并不是合批处理，因为 DrawCall 并不会减少，而是替代动态批处理的 CPU 优化方案，是一种用显存换性能的方案"}]},{"ID":"20250919160107-0hsfq4g","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250919160107-0hsfq4g","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250922111609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250922105709-oa5sv95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922105709-oa5sv95","updated":"20250922105709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意："}]},{"ID":"20250919160628-8r8x4t0","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919160628-8r8x4t0","updated":"20250922111609"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919160628-0zy49i4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919160628-0zy49i4","updated":"20250922111609"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919160628-31t6yzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919160628-31t6yzo","updated":"20250919160640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SRP Batcher 并不会直接减少 DrawCall 数量"}]},{"ID":"20250922105707-9yu7n3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922105707-9yu7n3h","updated":"20250922111609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它并没有合并 DrawCall，每个物体依然会产生 DrawCall，\n本质上是让 同一 Shader 的不同材质对象，共用已缓存的 GPU 常量缓冲，\n避免 CPU 反复上传数据，所以 Draw Call 数量不变，但 CPU 渲染线程时间（Render Thread）会显著下降"}]}]},{"ID":"20250919160628-k2tl7sq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250919160628-k2tl7sq","updated":"20250919160628"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919160628-uugux9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919160628-uugux9o","updated":"20250922105727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SRP Batcher 只能在 SRP 渲染管线，即 URP 和 HDRP 中使用"}]}]},{"ID":"20250919160628-rjuek34","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250919160628-rjuek34","updated":"20250922105735"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919160628-kdh0yu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919160628-kdh0yu6","updated":"20250919160628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优先级问题"}]},{"ID":"20250922105729-0a9sll9","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250922105729-0a9sll9","updated":"20250922105735"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922105730-wfusjj0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250922105730-wfusjj0","updated":"20250922105730"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922105730-m2sxwvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922105730-m2sxwvw","updated":"20250922105730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内置渲染管线中：静态批处理 \u003e GPU Instancing \u003e 动态批处理 \u003e 单独绘制"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922105731-kzgagd0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250922105731-kzgagd0","updated":"20250922105735"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922105731-al3o2z8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922105731-al3o2z8","updated":"20250922105735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SRP 管线中：静态批处理 \u003e SRP Batcher \u003e GPU Instancing \u003e 单独绘制"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250919160628-zg8udxi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250919160628-zg8udxi","updated":"20250922105803"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919160628-y5to296","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919160628-y5to296","updated":"20250922105803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虽然 SRP Batcher 并不会实际减少 DrawCall，但在 Frame Debugger 里只会显示 SRP Batch 条目，而不是每个物体的单独 DrawCall，但是实际上 GPU 仍然在分别绘制这些物体，只是 CPU 端提交被优化、合并了"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250922105836-410xgpm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250922105836-410xgpm","updated":"20250922112058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如何开启 SRP Batcher"}]},{"ID":"20250922105847-32l3xb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922105847-32l3xb8","updated":"20250922112057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 Unity 2021 后，在 SRP 管线（URP、HDRP）中该功能默认开启，不允许关闭了\n之前的版本中可以在 URP Asset 中的 Inspector 窗口勾选开启\n观察 SRP Batcher 是否工作，只需要用 Frame Debugger 查看渲染事件是否为 SRP Batch 即可"}]},{"ID":"20250922112057-shz9m8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922112057-shz9m8s","updated":"20250922112058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250922112058-7y7e4d8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250922105920-brfmgx4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250922105920-brfmgx4","updated":"20251125162710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SRP Batcher 的使用限制"}]},{"ID":"20250922105928-4h38uhp","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922105928-4h38uhp","updated":"20251125162710"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922105933-ccuwy6e","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922105933-ccuwy6e","updated":"20250922105933"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922105933-p2m7psx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922105933-p2m7psx","updated":"20250922105933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对象使用的 Shader 必须与 SRP Batcher 兼容"}]},{"ID":"20250922105936-t41cqrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922105936-t41cqrs","updated":"20250922105947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 HDRP 和 URP 中，所有 Lit Shader 和 Unlit Shader 都符合这一要求（除了它们的粒子版本）\n若要让一个自定义 Shader 与 SRP Batcher 兼容，它必须满足以下要求"}]},{"ID":"20250922105947-ebgfjj4","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922105947-ebgfjj4","updated":"20250922105947"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922105947-67p8jqe","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922105947-67p8jqe","updated":"20250922105947"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922105947-59sbjdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922105947-59sbjdp","updated":"20250922105952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader 必须将所有引擎内置属性声明在一个名为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"UnityPerDraw"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的常量缓冲区（Constant Buffer）里"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922105947-gg0vcg1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250922105947-gg0vcg1","updated":"20250922105947"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922105947-jw3vmdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922105947-jw3vmdz","updated":"20250922105958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader 必须将所有材质属性声明在一个名为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"UnityPerMaterial"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的常量缓冲区里"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250922114209-tc3e8x7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250922114209-tc3e8x7","updated":"20251125162710"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922114209-rwrnedh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922114209-rwrnedh","updated":"20251125162710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对象不能使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MaterialPropertyBlock"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250922114213-bu7ppqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922114213-bu7ppqs","updated":"20251121135848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MaterialPropertyBlock"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 是一个特殊的容器，用来在 不复制材质的情况下，给某个物体单独设置材质参数\n之后在讲解 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250919145831-3ema0jv","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"GPU Instancing"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 会提到"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922105933-7s1r7dz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250922105933-7s1r7dz","updated":"20250922105933"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922105933-0ol68hr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922105933-0ol68hr","updated":"20250922105933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对象不能是粒子"}]},{"ID":"20250922110025-pvtz4pc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110025-pvtz4pc","updated":"20250922110045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对象需要时 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MeshRenderer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 或 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SkinnedMeshRenderer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250922110045-skpayti","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250922110045-skpayti","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250922110046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250922110046-1dyq0ya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110046-1dyq0ya","updated":"20250922110050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意：蒙皮网格渲染器 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SkinnedMeshRenderer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 在新版本支持，Unity 2019 之前不支持"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250922110055-vwawees","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250922110055-vwawees","updated":"20250922114524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适合使用 SRP Batcher 的情况"}]},{"ID":"20250922110111-ft69yoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110111-ft69yoq","updated":"20250922110220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适合的场景：\nSRP Batcher 特别适合物体种类多（材质多），但是 Shader 相同的场景\n这也是为什么 SRP 管线非常适合移动平台开发的原因之一\n因为在移动平台开发时，游戏中的对象往往都是 Shader 相同，但是材质不同\n它虽然不减少 DrawCall 数量，但是减少了 CPU 在 SetPass 时的开销"}]},{"ID":"20250922110152-pts9qbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110152-pts9qbk","updated":"20250922110152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如："}]},{"ID":"20250922110121-os2dma1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922110121-os2dma1","updated":"20250922110149"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922110121-xn294eg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922110121-xn294eg","updated":"20250922110121"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922110121-06roex6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110121-06roex6","updated":"20250922110125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大量使用同一 Shader 的物体"}]},{"ID":"20250922110122-xfnev10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110122-xfnev10","updated":"20250922110131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景里有上百种建筑、石头、家具，它们的材质不同（颜色 / 贴图不同），但是都用相同的 Shader"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922110121-w8ukruw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250922110121-w8ukruw","updated":"20250922110121"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922110121-enkufit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110121-enkufit","updated":"20250922110136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大量动态物体，但材质切换频繁"}]},{"ID":"20250922110136-18gkuna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110136-18gkuna","updated":"20250922110136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大量移动的敌人、NPC, 动态场景物体（比如破碎的瓦片、掉落的武器），每个都有自己材质，但 Shader 相同"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922110121-z1q5r3y","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250922110121-z1q5r3y","updated":"20250922110149"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922110121-8wq6y8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110121-8wq6y8g","updated":"20250922110149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 URP / HDRP 项目的大中型游戏"}]},{"ID":"20250922110139-tq1yzb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110139-tq1yzb1","updated":"20250922110145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"特别是 移动端，CPU 渲染线程经常成为瓶颈时，SRP Batcher 能显著降低 CPU 耗时"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250922110116-gxvgs1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110116-gxvgs1j","updated":"20250922110117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不适合的场景："}]},{"ID":"20250922110117-9x5i7uo","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922110117-9x5i7uo","updated":"20250922114524"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922110117-2rkp4y7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250922110117-2rkp4y7","updated":"20250922114522"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922110117-v0ibq7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110117-v0ibq7h","updated":"20250922114522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"非 SRP 管线项目"}]}]},{"ID":"20250922110117-bcdrooc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250922110117-bcdrooc","updated":"20250922114524"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250922110117-uf563kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110117-uf563kj","updated":"20250922114524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader 不兼容"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250922110114-m6ng3et","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250922110114-m6ng3et","updated":"20250922110114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]}]}